  flavorText: 'Soldiers deal 20% more damage, +15% max health (existing, port as-is
    from CivilizationProfile.SoldierDamageMultiplier/MaxHealthMultiplier)

    Cavalry
    cost 15% less Gold (structural - lets Rajput field their signature unit type
    earlier/in greater numbers than the generic bonus alone would)

    Defeated
    Cavalry has a 25% chance to leave behind a weakened Infantry survivor instead
    of dying outright (reflects Rajput martial tradition of dismounted last-stand
    combat)

    Team bonus: Allied Cavalry get +1 flat damage (diluted version of
    Rajput Warrior Clans)'
